      "role": "user",
      "content": "there's nothing. i don't want to do anything. i look at the future and it's just a long, gray void. everyone who used to look up to me now looks through me like i'm glass. there's no \"rebuilding\" from this. you don't rebuild a burnt house, you just move on or you let the ashes sit there. i think i'm just at the ashes stage.",
